  displayName: Fire Drone Hub
  description: 'A white hub where firefighting drones dock, with a water tank and
    a sprinkler main. <color=#fc8>Protects 16 tiles round it from fire</color>: its
    crew put fires out and slow them spreading. <color=#9cf>Clean water</color>:
    sickness is less likely within 12 tiles, and does less harm there.'
